						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#104">Tindi Owns Server Split with Few Casualties</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Well now the server Split has come and Gone  it looks Like we Fared well. Not too many gone. The biggest loss is  Our friends  that did decide to go. they will be missed  and Never forgotten. On the Brighter Side we did get a new webpage at http://members.optushome.com.au/dakiwi/tindilosi/<br />
Check it out  Smaags Has done a great job for us. Next time you see him give him a pat on the pack (but not too hard you might hurt him hehe)<br />
Lets keep up the  work and look to start killing some new mobs and zones.. Till next time <br />
<br />
Later Ya'lls<br />
Semador
