					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We took down The Plane of Hate on the 15th of December (news travels slow in Norrath).  Much fun was had by most, cleric armor dropped like candy from a pinata at a Spanish kid's birthday, and we even managed to take out the Maestro, although Innoruuk wasn't up, so we couldn't take him down. =(<br />
<br />
Congratulations to everyone who received something, and thanks to everyone who attended.
